# 🌐 Personal Portfolio Website

A modern, responsive personal portfolio built using **React**, **Tailwind CSS (latest)**, and **Vite**.  
This project showcases my skills, projects, and experience with a focus on performance, accessibility, and clean UI/UX.

🔗 **Live Demo:** https://portfolio-beige-psi-45.vercel.app/ 
📦 **Repository:** https://github.com/hikrishu/portfolio.git

---

## ✨ Features

- ⚡ Fast build and optimized performance using Vite
- 🌗 Dark / Light mode toggle with smooth transitions
- 📱 Fully responsive (mobile-first design)
- 🧠 Clean design system using CSS variables + Tailwind
- 🖼 Lazy-loaded images for better performance
- 💀 Skeleton loaders and proper loading states
- 🚫 Error states & custom 404 page
- 📬 Contact form integration (Formspree)
- ♿ Accessible UI with proper ARIA labels
- 🎨 Subtle animations and floating background elements

---

## 🛠 Tech Stack

- **Frontend:** React (Functional Components)
- **Styling:** Tailwind CSS (latest, config-less)
- **animations:** CSS + Framer motion
- **Build Tool:** Vite
- **Forms:** React Hook Form + Formspree
- **Deployment:** Vercel
- **Version Control:** Git & GitHub

