## 🎨 Design System

- Fonts loaded via Google Fonts
  - **Headings:** Poppins
  - **Body:** Inter
- Colors managed using CSS variables
- Dark/light theme handled at root level
- No arbitrary Tailwind colors used (scalable approach)

---

## 📬 Contact Form

- Uses **Formspree** for backend-less form submission
- Integrated with **React Hook Form**
- Includes:
  - Validation
  - Loading state
  - Success & error feedback

---

## 🚀 Getting Started (Local Setup)

Clone the repository:

```bash
git clone https://github.com/hikrishu/portfolio.git
Install dependencies:

npm install
Run the development server:

npm run dev
Build for production:

npm run build
📦 Deployment
This project is deployed using Vercel.

Steps:

Push code to GitHub

Import repository into Vercel

Set framework preset to Vite

Deploy 🚀

